{"4529640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A2K: Jet Strikers", "steam_appid": 4529640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/e2461e9820cca5539606310ae80d3c91.poster.avif?t=1788287507\" width=800 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/e2461e9820cca5539606310ae80d3c91.webm?t=1788287507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/e2461e9820cca5539606310ae80d3c91.mp4?t=1788287507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/f0103e95dad581d478e365d91400979c.avif?t=1788287507\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras_big/f0103e95dad581d478e365d91400979c.webp?t=1788287507 width=1560 height=565 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A2K</strong> is a fast-paced, skill-based Arena Shooter built for players who enjoy movement, momentum, big weapons, and combat that turns into glorious chaos. Play solo with bots or jump in with friends Online / LAN. Shape your playstyle with upgrades for weapons, movement and abilities<u>,</u> because . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>IF BULLETS DON'T KILL IT, THE AIRSTRIKE WILL.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/f671b3033489dd3bfedda646a26ff9fd.poster.avif?t=1788287507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/f671b3033489dd3bfedda646a26ff9fd.webm?t=1788287507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/f671b3033489dd3bfedda646a26ff9fd.mp4?t=1788287507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLOSIVES — HITSCAN — BALISTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">16 current weapons and more to come! Rockets and explosive knockback, Rifles, Shotguns and a varied weapon arsenal created for fast duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> JETPACKS — PARKOUR — MOMENTUM </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chain jumps into bunnyhops, preserve speed through the map, control your jump arc in the air, and link ground movement smoothly into jetpack and superman flight mode. Learn routes, manage your speed, and turn movement itself into a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ABILITIES — UPGRADES — BUILDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade your Soldier to match your playstyle and explore new strategies and tactis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Push your weapons harder, sharpen your movement, and upgrade special attacks to create different builds from match to match. Go for raw speed, brute force, aerial pressure, or something in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MODDING — SANDBOX — CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A2K is built for sandbox experimentation and long-term modding options. Movement, weapons, and abilities can be customized for offline play as well as host-controlled multiplayer games. More modding options, including custom sound effects, emoji packs, and additional content tools, are planned for later.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/e2461e9820cca5539606310ae80d3c91.poster.avif?t=1788287507\" width=800 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/e2461e9820cca5539606310ae80d3c91.webm?t=1788287507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/e2461e9820cca5539606310ae80d3c91.mp4?t=1788287507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/f0103e95dad581d478e365d91400979c.avif?t=1788287507\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras_big/f0103e95dad581d478e365d91400979c.webp?t=1788287507 width=1560 height=565 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A2K</strong> is a fast-paced, skill-based Arena Shooter built for players who enjoy movement, momentum, big weapons, and combat that turns into glorious chaos. Play solo with bots or jump in with friends Online / LAN. Shape your playstyle with upgrades for weapons, movement and abilities<u>,</u> because . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>IF BULLETS DON'T KILL IT, THE AIRSTRIKE WILL.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/f671b3033489dd3bfedda646a26ff9fd.poster.avif?t=1788287507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/f671b3033489dd3bfedda646a26ff9fd.webm?t=1788287507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/extras/f671b3033489dd3bfedda646a26ff9fd.mp4?t=1788287507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLOSIVES — HITSCAN — BALISTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">16 current weapons and more to come! Rockets and explosive knockback, Rifles, Shotguns and a varied weapon arsenal created for fast duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> JETPACKS — PARKOUR — MOMENTUM </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chain jumps into bunnyhops, preserve speed through the map, control your jump arc in the air, and link ground movement smoothly into jetpack and superman flight mode. Learn routes, manage your speed, and turn movement itself into a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ABILITIES — UPGRADES — BUILDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade your Soldier to match your playstyle and explore new strategies and tactis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Push your weapons harder, sharpen your movement, and upgrade special attacks to create different builds from match to match. Go for raw speed, brute force, aerial pressure, or something in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MODDING — SANDBOX — CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A2K is built for sandbox experimentation and long-term modding options. Movement, weapons, and abilities can be customized for offline play as well as host-controlled multiplayer games. More modding options, including custom sound effects, emoji packs, and additional content tools, are planned for later.</p>", "short_description": "Movement-based action-shooter, inspired by the golden era of early 2000s games. Jetpacks, Momentum, Rocket-Jumps and violent Gunfights!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Czech, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hungarian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/b4572514e266ed3fc70879fc206f04369c0cb27f/header.jpg?t=1788287507", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/b6a536c1fbb7fc2ffcd106cfcbffb62142828dec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788287507", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529640/b6a536c1fbb7fc2ffcd106cfcbffb62142828dec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788287507", "website": "https://jetstrikers.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti / Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br